---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftTransferFinding
---
Construct a TransferFinding draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Assess performance on new tasks that change surface details and require the intended concept. Distinguish independent transfer from success under hints, update the learner model conservatively, and retain evidence for instructor review.
